{"name": "Dread of the Deep", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5127070/extras_big/555b3ffa95030b0ccd5b0c2643d2174a.webp?t=1790283928\" height=\"94\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5127070/extras/555b3ffa95030b0ccd5b0c2643d2174a.avif?t=1790283928\" width=\"1560\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Waves of creatures emerge from the darkness and attack from every direction. Turn your beam to aim your weapons, choose which side to defend, and collect the loot they leave behind. After each wave, return to the shop to buy weapons and upgrades before facing the next wave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"300\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5127070/extras/44b4a0ab4b9dc2de339be226be11bd04.poster.avif?t=1790283928\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5127070/extras/44b4a0ab4b9dc2de339be226be11bd04.webm?t=1790283928\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5127070/extras/44b4a0ab4b9dc2de339be226be11bd04.mp4?t=1790283928\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5127070/extras_big/16fdddbf48f8c34a7fbf2266d081f51b.webp?t=1790283928\" height=\"94\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5127070/extras/16fdddbf48f8c34a7fbf2266d081f51b.avif?t=1790283928\" width=\"1560\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combine weapons to make them stronger, or sacrifice one weapon to force its traits onto another. Some weapons can steal tags from sacrificed weapons, opening up combinations they couldn't normally use. Certain traits can trigger other weapons, letting one weapon trigger another and creating entire chains of effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5127070/extras/ad010c3d2f54a3e435d4840a4280e70f.poster.avif?t=1790283928\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5127070/extras/ad010c3d2f54a3e435d4840a4280e70f.webm?t=1790283928\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5127070/extras/ad010c3d2f54a3e435d4840a4280e70f.mp4?t=1790283928\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5127070/extras_big/5401b954136931dc6d237a29e448f379.webp?t=1790283928\" height=\"94\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5127070/extras/5401b954136931dc6d237a29e448f379.avif?t=1790283928\" width=\"1560\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Between runs, spend Talent Points in a sprawling <strong>200+ node branching tree</strong>. Choose paths like Offense, Utility, Economy, or Defense, then branch into specialized talents and capstones that can reshape how a build works.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some talents even unlock new weapons and items, changing what can appear in future runs. <strong>Respec freely and save your builds</strong> as you experiment with different ways to survive the deep.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5127070/extras/58c9ba6fe21c8baea71038fe54677cbd.poster.avif?t=1790283928\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5127070/extras/58c9ba6fe21c8baea71038fe54677cbd.webm?t=1790283928\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5127070/extras/58c9ba6fe21c8baea71038fe54677cbd.mp4?t=1790283928\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5127070/extras_big/3692fae6ad7644316da2d6ad8f8a86c7.webp?t=1790283928\" height=\"94\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5127070/extras/3692fae6ad7644316da2d6ad8f8a86c7.avif?t=1790283928\" width=\"1560\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock different lighthouses with their own rules, strengths, and weaknesses.  Each lighthouse changes the rules of a run, opening up new strategies, mechanics, and builds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"300\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5127070/extras/0d1df7153deea58c92da08c8e2da78f0.poster.avif?t=1790283928\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5127070/extras/0d1df7153deea58c92da08c8e2da78f0.webm?t=1790283928\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5127070/extras/0d1df7153deea58c92da08c8e2da78f0.mp4?t=1790283928\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5127070/extras_big/d4f73619a3a20a97d581ca9811199ed3.webp?t=1790283928\" height=\"94\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5127070/extras/d4f73619a3a20a97d581ca9811199ed3.avif?t=1790283928\" width=\"1560\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover corrupted items that pull your lighthouse into different realms. Push deeper into a story path and the sea itself begins to change, along with the horrors rising from it and the boss waiting below.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"300\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5127070/extras/600d12316b780950b602203c49543010.poster.avif?t=1790283928\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5127070/extras/600d12316b780950b602203c49543010.webm?t=1790283928\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5127070/extras/600d12316b780950b602203c49543010.mp4?t=1790283928\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5127070/extras_big/290cba308520ed3db6f0b6924a1a163d.webp?t=1790283928\" height=\"94\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5127070/extras/290cba308520ed3db6f0b6924a1a163d.avif?t=1790283928\" width=\"1560\"/></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One-input combat against hundreds of monsters attacking from every direction</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A branching meta-progression talent tree</strong> with multiple paths to develop your lighthouse</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">18 feats and milestones that earn talent points</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>80+ weapons</strong> across six schools</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">125+ items and 32 perks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Weapon crafting and sacrifice system for creating powerful combinations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>13 unlockable lighthouses</strong> with unique playstyles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Four difficulty levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple story paths that transform the world and its final boss</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Built for Steam Deck and controllers</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Aim your beam, fire, and choose which side to leave in the dark. Fight overwhelming hordes and combine weapons into powerful builds. Shape your lighthouse with a sprawling talent tree, and uncover what waits beneath the waves.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5127070/063c28b8f19105d1dc7918e0400483d4a5b755a9/header.jpg?t=1790283928", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Action Roguelike", "Action", "Roguelike", "Bullet Heaven", "Tower Defense", "Lovecraftian"], "developers": "Boosted Bytes", "publishers": "Boosted Bytes", "release_date": "Q4 2026", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "5127070", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "30 September 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/6X2usaiBRgw", "first_seen": 1790719200.0, "review_rank": 58}